{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1768669894\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your only advantage? The nearest enemy.</strong><br>From nimble archers to hulking brutes, every foe is a new tool in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.poster.avif?t=1768669894\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.webm?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.mp4?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Real-time Transformation</strong> \u2013 Instantly take the form of any enemy you defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.poster.avif?t=1768669894\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.webm?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.mp4?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Dash, strike, and react quickly in fast-paced, skill-based encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Strategic Choices</strong> \u2013 Every enemy has strengths and weaknesses. Choosing who to become can be the difference between victory and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.poster.avif?t=1768669894\" width=800 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.webm?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.mp4?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Card System</strong> \u2013 Pick temporary upgrades during each run to create powerful ability combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade Shop</strong> \u2013 Purchase permanent enhancements between runs to evolve your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/46796d3343fa124bd6c4eda8ff3c6740.poster.avif?t=1768669894\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/46796d3343fa124bd6c4eda8ff3c6740.webm?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/46796d3343fa124bd6c4eda8ff3c6740.mp4?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mode</strong> \u2013 How long can you last before the world consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No one masters monsters better than the one who becomes them.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847670?t=1768669894","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/6bd5a6e29ee65ecc859d607676fdecfb667d47a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768669894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/9797465da21bc3c80fcc2a6cb0b542f8d6215f89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768669894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/9797465da21bc3c80fcc2a6cb0b542f8d6215f89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768669894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1768669894\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847670/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1768669894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your only advantage? The nearest enemy.</strong><br>From nimble archers to hulking brutes, every foe is a new tool in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po